<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (5) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(6) Every person shall, before he is appointed a secretary of a company, make a declaration in the prescribed form that he is not in contravention of sections 139A and 139c and that he consents to act as a secretary of the company.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@> .
