<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The approved accounting standards shall apply to the accounts of a company or the consolidated accounts of a holding company if, at the time when the accounts or consolidated accounts are made out, the approved accounting standards—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@/~cl_5__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/45/msa@> .
